<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Cargo Dec '96 factor up at 73pc.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Cargo Dec '96 factor up at 73pc.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG increased its load factor 0.9 percentage points to 73 percent in December, parent company Deutsche Lufthansa AG said.</p>
<p>The following table from the Lufthansa investor relations department shows Lufthansa Cargo traffic for December 1996.</p>
<p>    Cargo/mail (1,000 tonnes)	143.1  up 0.6 pct</p>
<p>    Available cargo tonne-km (mln) 771    up 0.2 pct</p>
<p>    Revenue cargo tonne-km (mln)   563    up 1.5 pct</p>
<p>    Cargo load factor		  73     up 0.9 pct points</p>
<p>    Americas (1,000 t)		 38.0   up 4.7 pct</p>
<p>    Asia-Pacific (1,000 t)	   36.9   up 6.1 pct</p>
<p>    Europe (1,000 t)		   65.1   down 3.0 pct</p>
</text>
